# ---------------- Footprint.events (Task 16 Part E) ----------------
# One footprint puff. `TK_Player.events` spawns this template every 0.3 seconds while the player
# walks, so the trail follows the feet without a spawn per frame and without a .cs particle s.
#
# `my spawnedFrom` is the gate that keeps the template usable: an EventSheet component attaches
# even on an inactive actor, so an ungated block would play once at scene start and then
# `destroy me` itself, leaving nothing for the walk to clone (the muzzle flash taught us this).
#
# The look (two dark quads, fade-out, lifetime) lives in the `footprint` particle asset dragged
# onto this actor's ParticleEffect child — the sheet only plays it and cleans the clone up.

when me appears
  my spawnedFrom is "Footprint"
  play particle "footprint"
  wait 1.5 seconds
  destroy me
